        {"zh": "阳光懒散，等待猎物。", "en": "Sun lazy, waiting for prey."},
        {"zh": "静默中，等待猎物。", "en": "Silent, waiting for prey."},
        {"zh": "阳光下，从容不迫。", "en": "Sunlight, composed."},
