        {"zh": "岩浆中的誓言，永不背叛。", "en": "Promise in lava, never betray."},
        {"zh": "熔岩中的永恒承诺。", "en": "Eternal vow in lava."},
        {"zh": "岩浆中的亲密伴侣。", "en": "Intimate partners in lava."},
        {"zh": "共享炽热，熔岩永恒。", "en": "Share the heat, lava eternal."}
